{"t":"2026-10-22T18:50:01.342Z","event":"guard","launch":"0432-demo-builder","n":12,"role":"demo-builder","via":"hook","tool":"Bash","rule":"bash","why":"`<a command the guard cannot read>`: the guard cannot read this line, so it refuses it. To write a file, use the Write tool (not a shell heredoc or redirect); otherwise spell the command out in plain words (no $(…), `…` or variable as a command, git subcommand or script name)","detail":"cd /home/user/s3c-wt/base/.claude/worktrees/b6-LESSON-drivers-stop-switching/src/demos/cs/drivers-stop-switching && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Demo.tsx'\ns=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep(\"\"\"// all-B (55 min) / all-A (60 min) round after round; the me"}
